1073
00:42:19,872 --> 00:42:21,040
Maybe we made a mistake.

1074
00:42:21,040 --> 00:42:22,575
- [Greta] Maybe you did.

1075
00:42:22,575 --> 00:42:24,008
- [Tom] A big one.

1076
00:42:24,008 --> 00:42:24,910
