1104
00:43:27,105 --> 00:43:29,642
Go Gene go, go Gene go.
- Go Gene go, go Gene go, go.

1105
00:43:31,277 --> 00:43:34,613
(speaking foreign language)

1106
00:43:34,613 --> 00:43:37,182
- [Tom] I now pronounce
you man and man.

1107
00:43:37,182 --> 00:43:38,017
- Huh?

1108
