1222
00:47:36,255 --> 00:47:39,490
This is the Lucy scope.

1223
00:47:39,490 --> 00:47:43,095
- Ah Ricky, turns out
I was never funny.

1224
00:47:43,095 --> 00:47:46,998
- Okay, the small
intestine scope.

