1226
00:47:51,002 --> 00:47:52,203
- That's what we feel like.

1227
00:47:52,203 --> 00:47:56,808
- This is the Jose
Feliciano scope there.

1228
00:47:56,808 --> 00:47:59,043
- [Tom] Chico, don't
