00:48:09,722 --> 00:48:10,555
- Huh? Tricky.

1234
00:48:10,555 --> 00:48:13,792
- The glaucoma scope.

1235
00:48:13,792 --> 00:48:15,027
What?
- What?

1236
00:48:15,027 --> 00:48:16,862
- And if you wanna get
really fancy you add the

1237
00:48:16,862 --> 00:48:19,598
family circus scope
with the glaucoma scope

1238
00:48:19,598 --> 00:48:22,033
