1239
00:48:22,033 --> 00:48:23,202
There's that.

1240
00:48:23,202 --> 00:48:25,770
Followed by the Pope scope.

1241
00:48:27,005 --> 00:48:30,275
The scope's Monkey Trial scope,

1242
00:48:30,275 --> 00:48:32,443
