00:48:33,812 --> 00:48:36,382
The ever popular nope scope.

1244
00:48:36,382 --> 00:48:37,548
- [Tom] Oh brother.

1245
00:48:37,548 --> 00:48:38,717
- [Croooow] Come on.

1246
00:48:38,717 --> 00:48:42,453
