1251
00:48:57,068 --> 00:48:58,103
- [Joel] Oh that binocular
seems pretty good.

1252
00:48:58,103 --> 00:48:59,137
- [Tom] That's really cool.

1253
00:48:59,137 --> 00:49:00,372
- Yeah.

1254
00:49:00,372 --> 00:49:01,807
